ep is age-gated (an ungated sweep deletes a concurrent\n60|`Bind`'s live stage — new keep/sweep tests plus `N-store-sweep-age`);\n61|the `doc.go` drift claim reworded (§13.1 insertion, measured);\n62|missing create entry-deadline and first-effect reported-`stop_timeout`\n63|pins added (the two stop directions now measured together);\n64|previously unmeasured gates rowed (kind mapping, fencing operation,\n65|both timeout-code arms, status source, six `checkParams` arms, the\n66|version-tuple delegation, body scope/member-set, both wire-order\n67|sorts); the bootstrap row caught a weak `err==nil` assertion, now a\n68|literal code+detail refusal. New bounds are stated in TRACEABILITY\n69|(AX-side seam emissions vs row sets, lesser-of-timeout ownership,\n70|document/Go twin masking, engine-scope fail-fast ordering).\n71|\n72|## AC coverage: 72 of 72 rows driven\n73|\n74|Measured, not restated: 72 data rows counted in\n75|`internal/terminstance/TRACEABILITY.md`, 70 named top-level tests all\n76|present via `go test -list` and 7 cited subtests all `--- PASS`\n77|(zero missing; see `ratio-check.log`), and the full package suite\n78|green (`terminstance-test-v.log`: exit 0, 168 `--- PASS` including\n79|subtests, 0 `--- FAIL`). Production call sites are named per row in\n80|the matrix.\n81|\n82|## Negative and mutant evidence\n83|\n84|- `mutant_harness.py`: 70/70 rows match on two full passes with\n85|  identical verdict lists — 68 narrowing KILLED + 1 tightening edge\n86|  KILLED + the SURVIVED control. The tightening row\n87|  (`N-auth-epoch-high`) is documented: weakening past `MaxLeaseEpoch`\n88|  is equivalent because `environ` refuses 2^53 at the number layer,\n89|  so the row proves the edge is exactly 9007199254740991 by refusing\n90|  it. Per-plant raw logs with subprocess exits in `mutants/pass1/`\n91|  and `mutants/pass2/` (70 plants each, `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1`,\n92|  no `__pycache__`); production blobs verified byte-identical\n93|  before/after/across passe