-timeout-disposition: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Reports exactly a committed terminal_backend_timeout as replay_same instead of status_first; other committed codes still route through status. [exit 1]\\nok: N-engine-recheck-auth-third: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Skips the per-effect auth recheck exactly before the third effect; rechecks before effects 1 and 2 stay. [exit 1]\\nok: N-engine-recheck-generation-third: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Skips the per-effect generation recheck exactly before the third effect; rechecks before effects 1 and 2 stay. [exit 1]\\nok: N-engine-bind-postlink: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Restores the source for exactly standing receipts as well as for nothing-durable; the hook-error commit then restores instead of fencing uncertain. [exit 1]\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1520,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 380,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
