le still leave. [exit 1]\\nok: N-fencing-source-creating: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Fences only parked, active and quiescing; the materializing creating incarnation no longer fences. [exit 1]\\nok: N-status-session-scoped: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Skips the reported-session comparison for exactly the Session-scoped lookup, adopting a foreign session report; the exact path still compares. [exit 1]\\nok: N-status-session-exact: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Skips the reported-session comparison for exactly the exact-instance lookup, adopting a foreign session report; the Session-scoped path still compares. [exit 1]\\nok: N-status-match-instance: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Drops exactly the instance conjunct from the identity_match conjunction; the other five axes still compare. [exit 1]\\nok: N-status-match-backend: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Drops exactly the backend conjunct from the identity_match conjunction; the other five axes still compare. [exit 1]\\nok: N-status-match-implementation: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Drops exactly the implementation conjunct from the identity_match conjunction; the other five axes still compare. [exit 1]\\nok: N-status-match-protocol: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Drops exactly the protocol conjunct from the identity_match conjunction; the other five axes still compare. [exit 1]\\nok: N-status-match-generation: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Drops exactly the generation conjunct from the identity_match conjunction; the other five axes still compare. [exit 1]\\nok: N-engine-deadline-instant: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the now == deadline_at instant at the mutating entry; past-deadline instants still refuse. [exit 1]\\nok: N-status-deadline-instant: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the now == deadline_at instant at the status entry; past-deadline instants still refuse. [exit 1]\\nok: N-auth-kind-attach: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the landed attach name (an AttachAuthorization kind, never an AXAuthorization kind) as control; every other