{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000dc8d","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b291-18f0-70a0-900f-0c92cf0433eb"},"sequence":3233,"recorded_at":1780531400006461,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"cb7c4ff2-7892-4304-8de0-3769502303db","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"cb7c4ff2-7892-4304-8de0-3769502303db","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"cb7c4ff2-7892-4304-8de0-3769502303db"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b2b4-b432-74e2-948e-133afcfa630a"},"task_id":"01a0b2b4-b432-74e2-948e-133afcfa630a","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b2b4-b432-74e2-948e-133afcfa630a","chunk":"Read text file `README.md`.\n(2209 line(s) above)\n2210|`doctor` result, and no runtime capability claim; the clause-to-test matrix\n2211|with its stated bounds lives in\n2212|[the task evidence map](internal/axpane/TRACEABILITY.md).\n2213|\n2214|\n2215|## Terminal Instance lifecycle execution (`terminstance` engine)\n2216|\n2217|[`internal/terminstance`](internal/terminstance) executes the Terminal\n2218|Instance lifecycle contract of the pinned Sections 4.B-4.D, 5.2, 7.A,\n2219|and 13.1 over the landed `terminalbackend` semantic core: the closed\n2220|`AXAuthorization` object (lease UUIDv4, epoch uint53 bound, holder\n2221|UUIDv7, kind, timestamps, evidence digest) parsed through the landed\n2222|`environ` closed-shape discipline, the closed `RetryDisposition` and\n2223|`ProviderProofKind` enums, the mutating-request/response identity\n2224|contract (`MutationContext`/`MutationResult` with exact idempotency key\n2225|material per row), and the `Engine` that binds the durable idempotency\n2226|receipt before the first side effect, rechecks authorization and\n2227|generation immediately before each side effect, restores the source\n2228|state on pre-effect errors, moves to `unavailable` with `status_first`\n2229|on unprovable post-effect errors (never claiming `absent`), and cancels\n2230|waiting — never a committed effect — on deadline. `creating` is entered\n2231|only by `create` between receipt and first effect, only `quiesce-input`\n2232|enters `quiescing`, and `stale_fenced` is entered only by fencing\n2233|observation through the landed `fencing` park vocabulary, never by a\n2234|backend operation. The receipt store commits under the no-replace plus\n2235|fsync discipline with crash hooks and byte-agrees with the landed\n2236|`Ledger` encoding; status performs no receipt, effect, or transition of\n2237|its own and a timeout or read failure is unknown, never absent.\n2238|\n2239|Run the focused tests and coverage with:\n2240|\n2241|```bash\n2242|go test ./internal/terminstance -count=1\n2243|go test ./internal/terminstance -cover -count=1\n2244|```\n2245|\n2246|Run the narrowing battery (68 narrowing mutants, one tightening edge\n2247|row, plus one harmless control) with:\n2248|\n2249|```bash\n2250|PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 internal/terminstance/mutant_harness.py\n2251|```\n2252|\n2253|The harness mutates one production file in place, runs the named killer\n2254|through the production entry point, restores the file from backup, and\n2255|reports per-row verdicts with subprocess exits; `AX_MUTANT_VERBOSE=1`\n2256|additionally prints the raw per-plant logs. Task validation logs and\n2257|mutation artifacts are attached to `TASK-260830-kkh1an`. The package\n2258|adds no `ax` command, no `doctor` result, and no runtime capability\n2259|claim; the clause-to-test matrix with its stated bounds lives in\n2260|[the task evidence map](internal/terminstance/TRACEABILITY.md).\n2261|\n2262|## Ownership reducer properties\n2263|\n2264|The four story-pinned ownership invariants (pinned v0.6.0 Sections 2.2, 5.3,\n(more lines below)","final_result":true}}}
