7, kind closed 4, timestamps, digest | `ParseAXAuthorization` | member/kind/expiry tests |\n24|| Unknown/missing member, frame violations | `ParseAXAuthorization` | `TestParseAXAuthorizationClosedShape` |\n25|| Kind, expiry, lease binding | `CheckAuthorization` | `TestCheckAuthorizationAdmitsWinningLease`, `TestCheckAuthorizationRefusals` |\n26|\n27|## Closed enums and mapping (§4.C)\n28|\n29|| Clause | Production entry | Committed test |\n30|| --- | --- | --- |\n31|| RetryDisposition closed 4 + census | `ParseRetryDisposition` | `TestParseRetryDispositionClosed`, `TestClosedEnumsAreExactlyPinned` |\n32|| Per-code mapping (26 rows) | `DispositionFor` | `TestDispositionForMapping` |\n33|| ProviderProofKind closed 3 + classification | `ParseProviderProofKind`, `RequiresProviderObservation` | proof tests |\n34|| AuthorizationKind closed 4 + census | `ParseAuthorizationKind` | `TestParseAuthorizationKindClosed` |\n35|\n36|## Request/result identity (§4.C)\n37|\n38|| Clause | Production entry | Committed test |\n39|| --- | --- | --- |\n40|| MutationContext closed 10 + members, doc + Go twins | `ParseMutationContext` | `TestParseMutationContextAdmitsClosedFixture`, `TestParseMutationContextMemberRefusals`, `TestCheckMutationContextVersionArms` |\n41|| Generation 0/256/257 + multibyte | `ParseMutationContext`, `CheckMutationContext` | bound tests |\n42|| Key material exact per row | `KeySegments` | `TestKeySegmentsDerivesRowMaterial` |\n43|| Carried-key consistency | `CheckMutationContext` | `TestCheckMutationContextKeyMaterial` |\n44|| Per-op params | `CheckMutationContext` | `TestCheckMutationContextParams` |\n45|| Operation bodies closed + scope | `ParseOperationBody` | `TestParseOperationBodyAdmitsRows`, `TestParseOperationBodyRefusals`, `TestParseOperationBodyScopeGate` |\n46|| Status body + null-pair rule | `ParseStatusBody` | `TestParseStatusBodyAdmitsBothScopes`, `TestParseStatusBodyNullPairRule`, `TestParseStatusBodyMemberRefusals` |\n47|| Result repetition + shap